    "questionText": "Как остановить и удалить Docker контейнер?",
    "shortAnswer": "`docker stop` — graceful (SIGTERM, 10s, SIGKILL). `docker rm` — удалить (сначала stopped). `docker rm -f` — stop+remove. `docker rm -v` — + anonymous volumes. `--rm` на run для auto-cleanup.",
    "idealAnswer": "stop: SIGTERM → grace 10s → SIGKILL; stop -t N custom. kill: immediate SIGKILL. rm: delete metadata+writable layer, must be stopped. rm -f: kill+remove. rm -v: anonymous volumes too; named spared. container prune, compose down, down -v wipes named. run --rm auto-remove on exit. DB: stop not kill/rm -f (WAL). Ошибки: rm running; rm -f postgres; orphan anonymous without -v; stop vs pause.",
    "maxScore": 10,
    "skills": [
      "docker"
    ]
